# text = And I wonder , Richard , you can think of bothering your head about our POVERTY in case of your death ; as if THAT would be anything compared with the calamity of losing you -- an affliction that you well know would swallow up all others , and which you ought to do your utmost to preserve us from : and there is nothing like a cheerful mind for keeping the body in health I know , Alice , it is wrong to keep repining as I do , but I cannot help it : you must bear with me I WON'T bear with you , if I can alter you Mamma my money is but little , and cannot last long ; if I could increase it , it would lessen papa's anxiety , on one subject at least .
