# text = But , let me tell you , you are a good deal paler and thinner than when you first left home ; and we cannot have you undermining your health to hoard up money either for yourself or others Mary tells me I am changed too ; and I don't much wonder at it , for I was in a constant state of agitation and anxiety all day long : but next time I am determined to take things coolly Your talents are not such as every poor clergyman's daughter possesses , Agnes and you must not throw them away .
