# text = Remember , you promised to be patient : there is no need of hurry : you have plenty of time before you , and may have many chances yet Music , singing , drawing , French , Latin , and German are no mean assemblage : many will be glad to have so much in one instructor ; and this time , you shall try your fortune in a somewhat higher family in that of some genuine , thoroughbred gentleman ; for such are far more likely to treat you with proper respect and consideration than those purse-proud tradespeople and arrogant upstarts .
