# text = She was very obliging , quiet , and peaceable in the main , but there were some things that put her out of temper : they did not much care for that , to be sure , but still it was better to keep her in tune ; as when she was in a good humour she would talk to them , and be very agreeable and amusing sometimes , in her way ; which was quite different to mamma's , but still very well for a change .
