# text = I'll be hanged if she doesn't I'm sorry to hear , Miss Matilda , that you've not got rid of that shocking habit yet Well , I can't help it : but I'll never say a wicked word again , if you'll only listen to me , and tell Rosalie to hold her confounded tongue like winking Oh , Matilda ! what stories you are telling Well I know I COULD clear a five-barred gate , if I tried , and papa WILL say I may hunt , and mamma WILL order the habit when I ask it Well , now get along and do , dear Matilda , try to be a little more lady-like .
