# text = Except under peculiar circumstances , I consider very close and constant study as a waste of time , and an injury to the mind as well as the body Well , I have neither the time nor the inclination for such transgressions no need to be in such agitation about the matter -- it might prove a false alarm after all ; and if not -- why , it was only in the common course of nature : we must all die some time ; and I was not to suppose myself the only afflicted person in the world ;' and concluding with saying I might have the phaeton to take me to O -. '
