# text = There's many a poor clergyman whose family would be plunged into ruin by the event of his death ; but you , you see , have influential friends ready to continue their patronage , and to show you every consideration consideration Agnes Oh , Agnes How is he Dead No , Mary if Richardson and you have anything to spare , you must lay it aside for your family ; and Agnes and I must gather honey for ourselves .
